- Path: `{{ tgt.path }}`
- Type: {{ tgt.type }}

## Summary
- Verdict: {{ sum.verdict }}
- Static: {{ sum.static }}
- Top patterns: {{ sum.top_patterns if sum.top_patterns is string else (sum.top_patterns or []) | join(", ") }}

## Severity summary
- Critical: {{ sev_line(sev.critical) }}
- Major: {{ sev_line(sev.major) }}
- Minor: {{ sev_line(sev.minor) }}

## Findings (narrative)

{{ findings_narrative | default("", true) | trim }}

